s2 =~ 0*OES + 1*T2OES + 2*T3OES + 3*T4OES
s1 ~~ i2
s2 ~~ i1'
GPOSOES2.fit <- growth(GPOSOES2.model, data = d, estimator = "DWLS")

This also produced similar warning message:
