> But when trying to generate residuals from the model of type "casewise"
> as part of that process,
> I see all the residuals are zero. Is that a sign that the model is
> completely wrong?

No. It is a misunderstanding (mostly among ecologists for some reason),
about the nature of these 'residuals': these residuals are (in lavaan
0.5-20) not the same residuals as in regression models.

See my comment about this here:

https://github.com/yrosseel/lavaan/issues/44

Yves.

